      "label": "Hateful Meme",
      "description": "The meme is classified as hateful because it uses a Black person’s image to represent a stereotype or to imply that Black people are being treated as inferior or less than human in a public space. The juxtaposition of Drake’s satisfied expression with the text about racial segregation implies that Black people are being subjected to racial discrimination in a demeaning and dehumanizing way. This is not merely humorous; it is a form of racial stereotyping and reinforces harmful racial hierarchies.",
