      "instance_name": "satisfaction",
      "label": "satisfied emotion",
      "description": "Drake is smiling broadly with a relaxed, content expression, and gesturing with his hand in a way that suggests amusement or approval. This facial expression and body language convey a sense of satisfaction or enjoyment, which is juxtaposed with the meme's text to imply approval or mockery of racial segregation.",
